| Bed Availability Agent | Finds beds/wards matching required operational constraints. | `validated_requirement + bed_inventory` | `eligible_beds` |
| Turnaround Readiness Agent | Checks discharge/cleaning/readiness state for candidate beds. | `eligible_beds + readiness_data` | `readiness_results` |
| Capacity Pressure Agent | Calculates ward occupancy pressure and escalation thresholds. | `ward_capacity + queue` | `capacity_score, flags` |
| Bed Coordination Decision Agent | Produces the operational recommendation without making clinical decisions. | `all agent outputs` | `final_recommendation` |

