| Documentation Agent | Checks required supporting documents for the claim type. | `validated_claim + document_rules` | `document_status` |
| Duplicate & Consistency Agent | Checks duplicate keys and basic field consistency. | `validated_claim + historical_claims` | `duplicate_flags, consistency_flags` |
| Policy Routing Agent | Applies administrative routing rules and threshold checks. | `validated_claim + policy_rules` | `policy_route, policy_flags` |
| Claims Triage Decision Agent | Combines evidence into a routing recommendation. | `all agent outputs` | `final_recommendation` |

## 9. Agent Responsibilities

